# <type>(<scope>): <subject>  <-- ≤72 chars, imperative, no trailing period
#
# Types:    feat, fix, refactor, perf, test, docs, chore, build, ci, style, revert
# Scopes:   frontend/<area>, backend/<area>, database/<area>, security/<area>,
#           devops/<area>, qa/<area>, docs, contracts, types, repo
#
# Body: wrap at 72, explain *why* (the diff shows *what*). Blank line between subject and body.
#
# Footer: "BREAKING CHANGE: <explain>", "Refs #123", "Closes #123", "Co-Authored-By: <name> <email>"
#
# Examples:
#   feat(frontend/pdp): shade selector with swatch previews
#   fix(backend/cart): validate coupon against current cart items
#   chore(devops/ci): cache pnpm store between runs
#   feat(backend/order)!: rename orderStatus `confirmed` → `placed`
#
# Rules enforced by commitlint — hook will reject non-conforming messages.
